OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 70, died of eye cancer after
OL,4,Ascan concerns weren't followed up
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 70-year-old man died of eye cancer
OL,7,Fafter a recommended appointment was not
OL,8,Ffollowed up by health professionals, an
OL,9,Finquest found.
OL,11,FAlexandar McDonald died at the Grange
OL,12,FUniversity Hospital in Cwmbran,
OL,13,FTorfaen, on 30 November 2025, from the
OL,14,Feffects of metastatic choroidal
OL,15,Fmelanoma.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
