OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 70, died of eye cancer after
OL,4,Ascan concerns weren't followed up
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut a coroner found he could have begun
OL,7,Ftreatment six months earlier, and
OL,8,Fwarned more patients in Wales were at
OL,9,F"significant risk", as figures showed
OL,10,F140,000 ophthalmology follow-up
OL,11,Fappointments awaiting review, but just
OL,12,F65 consultant ophthalmologists
OL,13,Favailable.
OL,15,FThe Welsh government said it was "vital
OL,16,Fthat lessons are learned from this
OL,17,Ftragic case, caused by unacceptable
OL,18,Ffailings in the management of
OL,19,Freferrals".
